teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299290/ss_d19dc2b3cc4ab396f8fda25c9e109a2648c893de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1742376922","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299290/ss_d19dc2b3cc4ab396f8fda25c9e109a2648c893de.600x338.jpg?t=1742376922"}],"short_description":"Armed with God-given powers, the revived tribune Adrestia is given a second chance to save the universe from her maniacal twin sister. Find secrets, acquire upgrades, and dominate mighty foes through sheer combat prowess as you explore and conquer the horrors of the forsaken vessel Atromitos.","steam_appid":1299290,"support_info":{"email":"team@bonusstage.co","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"http://somberechoes.com"}